{"id":2244,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年12月30日下午四点，我院“凝心聚力 温暖前行”2026年元旦联欢会在学院楼314、310、316室及职工之家同步举行，主会场设在314会议室。院工会组织本次活动，吸引了众多教职工积极参与。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnzvIPL8rRnmN4L54-YLmN4Lzvbn7UCPnmMVUm-sLznVMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y8oShkMSyaLz7YLRviUmTkUNlYLRL4L49bU4lPMzV7L8rFn7U4LRNPU4fFM87aLN-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsoRvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/649B50112075B9BBE2033389C5151D3E/DD3091C0/7A02B\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rM4GI4Ulr2L4U8M5zQ2LmLDU4nfUNLC8Mm62LNVknzUiMl-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyYLSysMkyao7nfLzT7U4rRnl-8nRv4UN-ZMlUaM4vPnm6FolCanzUYU8MFMR6RMllbgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSysM49sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\"></p><p>活动伊始，院党委书记罗建国发表新年致辞，全面回顾了过去一年学院在党建、学科建设、教学科研、师资队伍建设与学生工作等方面取得的成果，并展望未来，向全体教师致以诚挚的新年祝福。随后，院党委副书记、工会主席张丽花通报了工会经费使用情况，表彰了本年度工会活动积极分子，并颁发证书和纪念品以资鼓励。全体与会院领导和受表彰人员合影留念。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rMRnI2M7-bolLsU5lCPM8QVLzGaM4GCiol7ZolUPMNCiLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y4oSyPoky8LzGin7UYM4viLN-Ynm-8LzCaM4TkUmQ2o7rFozGsnlCiL4rFM7n7M8lJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsoRvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B39184105DD27752B2F2416079BB6F8E/907EF535/4DD7E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rLmNI8U49DMz-Zn5lUDMNQ2olWRLlCCsoz94oz9bU4fRozL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDUSy8MShVM7lZnm-8MNnkL4CZM4AfMz7YLzQRL7WkL8WFU8r2oRTfLNWFLzN8U8-PgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSysM49sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\"></p><p>随后进行的“击鼓传花”互动环节将现场气氛迅速点燃。随着鼓点响起，吉祥物“红马”在众人手中飞快传递，接到“红马”的教职工即兴展示才艺，诗歌朗诵、歌曲演唱、故事分享、脑筋急转弯等节目轮番上演，现场掌声与笑声此起彼伏。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ro7lIDMmCZL4VVn57MVM4UiLl74L4UCYUzL8LNW7Mm67LRN0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPLkysoSybL47DLz-YnzvPMlC4MRTknNW7U4f2Ulr2M4nFo7CZMmVRnmnFLNMRnllJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsoRvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B10799316122E715F349BFBDC0FAEF74/8F861CF4/2CCEE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnmWIVn77aMmGao5RGbMRnRLmNanmLCYM4vZLNCaLz9YM4N0gihFp2hmCIa0USyanky8L1hRLRv8LzUiM49YMmNZM7LsnRV7nzUbU8MVnRTFLRV7U4nkLzAFLN7ZnRMRgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSysM49sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\"></p><p>之后，活动还设置了掼蛋、升级等轻松愉快的牌类游戏环节，教职工们在牌桌前默契配合、欢声不断。最后的颁奖环节再次将节日氛围推向高潮，为联欢会画上圆满句号。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rUmVIVUzTRL4nkM5z7ZU49iU4-YUNLC8U878MmfRLmfVM490gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVLShknkyYUzTVMmLiL7-bnmQ2LNLYU8nRMRr7L4GaozfFUN-sLRT7n7rFMl7YLlUJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsoRvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DE1BD2A9E6350B9F6F2C2CDC45D30090/BB709DDE/5A21D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rLlLIiMNM2nmfkM5mGYMRl8MznfLmNC8M4AkMNrVnlCZnlL0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaMYysnSh7L8-snlUboRLsnmLDM7W7M8LsozfkU8-iLzMFn7WkUNliL4TFLzn2n774gtXaQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSysM49sgtA8pUQcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次元旦联欢会丰富了教职工的业余文化生活，增强了团队凝聚力与彼此交流，也激发了大家对2026年的美好憧憬。学院全体教师将继续携手并肩，共同推动学院高质量发展，为学校“双一流”建设贡献更大力量。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=rnzvIPL8rRnmN4L54-YLmN4Lzvbn7UCPnmMVUm-sLznVMmG0gihFp2hmCIa0M1y8oShkMSyaLz7YLRviUmTkUNlYLRL4L49bU4lPMzV7L8rFn7U4LRNPU4fFM87aLN-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg4vsoRvJqdQnx&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=7787&e=.jpg"}